{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":42189,\"title\":\"Kevin Hart: Seriously Funny\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Fresh off the heels of appearing in movies like Superhero Movie and The 40 Year-Old Virgin, fast-talking comedian Kevin Hart stars in his second live stand-up performance in Cleveland, Ohio, where he makes fun of everything and everybody - especially himself.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xzmEzbqIS52IhfN7InU2KsljY04.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jOpQjUqTgmiiYwesOEbTgxLlP75.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":188,\"year\":2010,\"runtime\":72,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\",\"TV Movie\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Shannon Hartman\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1827779,\"name\":\"Shannon Hartman\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":55638,\"name\":\"Kevin Hart\",\"character\":\"Himself\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/byiNydUlM6oP8diA7WMvYbNM7a1.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":339927,\"title\":\"Kevin Hart: What Now?\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lFg4tx0jAYkgrcm1bPBlM0FbQvH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d4pIsjOiPz8CUhkBCXFJVxSwNDY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Comedian Kevin Hart performs in front of a crowd of 50,000 people at Philadelphia's outdoor venue, Lincoln Financial Field.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Documentary\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":367735,\"title\":\"John Mulaney: The Comeback Kid\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pzM9t33T2YUA7vaCb2GxaDrlTW1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8iTGzNjDAFsn2zZr6sdJ79GLp5K.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Armed with boyish charm and a sharp wit, the former \\\"SNL\\\" writer offers sly takes on marriage, his beef with babies and the time he met Bill Clinton.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":613999,\"title\":\"Aziz Ansari: Right Now\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5vaYOkQ3MxOnxQLeKUNXiAfZVHb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2QyZSGSGIGqeODxBc2ssltu4ldj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a comedy special directed by Spike Jonze, Aziz Ansari shares deep personal insights and hilarious takes on wokeness, family and the social climate.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13015,\"title\":\"George Carlin: Life Is Worth Losing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/djoek5ZJA1J7E6vD0jAoUN5Mqjb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7U3azp9x1eWEQKSYOIgksZ7ie40.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Carlin returns to the stage in his 13th live comedy stand-up special, performed at the Beacon Theatre in New York City for HBO®. His spot-on observations on the deterioration of human behavior include Americans’ obsession with their two favorite addictions - shopping and eating; his creative idea for The All-Suicide Channel, a new reality TV network; and the glorious rebirth of the planet to its original pristine condition - once the fires and floods destroy life as we know it.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":161803,\"title\":\"CM101MMXI Fundamentals\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nwmoYBOPJ2tLthK4z8rgfnHLu5D.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kQKJCku7vhz9Wce2PFm6ehWcBPh.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The funny little details of everyday life,  simple things that make us laugh.  An unforgettable performance from Cem Yilmaz.  Yilmaz captures the audience with his hilarious stories about relationships, humankind's struggle with the technology and professional life. Yilmaz proves us that a food delivery or even a funeral might be amusing when considered correctly.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1255883,\"title\":\"Alex Edelman: Just for Us\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kUFBY1vF4sCHVTv1Oy9s23269Or.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x7FvGNMA451hCIGTS23x98midnc.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the wake of a string of anti-Semitic threats pointed in his direction online, Edelman decides to go straight to the source; specifically, Queens, where he covertly attends a meeting of White Nationalists and comes face-to-face with the people behind the keyboards.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1062224,\"title\":\"Lieven Scheire: DNA\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wAXiZQbIz4PMMUsVjOJA4BwFiF7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5G5WArHYNCxgLqJUrogDotw5BZa.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Human genetics is one of the most exciting fields in science at the moment. Not only does it advance exponentially fast, it is also a field of study that will very soon affect our daily lives. We will all have to deal with the possibilities and technologies that human genetics have to offer, today and in the coming years.  Quite a few questions and dilemmas still have to be answered by us. Do I want to know everything that can be found out from my DNA? And who is allowed to use and read my genetic code? My doctor? The police? The chef of my favourite restaurant?  Also, what genetic technologies do I want to use? Do I want to clone my dog, choose my children’s eye colour, or genetically modify them to give them extra talents? Do I want others in society to be allowed to do that?  The current and future possibilities of human genetics are simply overwhelming. They are both promising and frightening, chilling and delightful.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"XF5jx-QaEqA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"qOiCXC7TVHw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"FaMVv67bsLg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}